# Kit Plane B — ids decision.kit.* only.


decision decision.kit.packages-compose-apps
  statement: Primary axis is packages compose apps (ADR-0001). Product domain stays out of packages/*; example-* proves composition synthetically.
  status: declared
  provenance: author
  serves: goal.kit.capability-kernel
  justifies: invariant.kit.product-domain-never-packages
  link: file:docs/kit/architecture/adr/0001-primary-axis-packages-compose-apps.md
  tag: kit

decision decision.kit.flows-authority-split
  statement: Authority is grants ∩ permits ∩ registry at check/snapshot time (ADR-0005 D4). The runner sees only an immutable RunnerView.
  status: declared
  provenance: author
  serves: goal.kit.tenant-isolation
  justifies: invariant.kit.grants-are-sole-max-power
  justifies: invariant.kit.runner-executes-snapshot-only
  justifies: invariant.kit.default-deny-ambient-authority
  link: file:docs/kit/architecture/adr/0005-flows-platform-agentic-workflows.md
  tag: kit
  tag: security

decision decision.kit.namespace-polarity
  statement: Ownership is path-encoded (ADR-0009) — {config,scripts,docs}/kit vs */product. Dual-edit base is config/product/inheritance.json, never upstream/main.
  status: declared
  provenance: author
  serves: goal.kit.extractible-compose
  link: file:docs/kit/architecture/adr/0009-kit-namespace-polarity-inheritance-marker.md
  tag: kit
